Each transformer block consists of two main modules: a multihead self-attention mechanism and a feed-forward neural network. The multihead self-attention mechanism enables the model to weigh the relevance of different input elements in the input set when generating output representations. In our case, we use 16 attention heads, token dimensionality \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
